EntityDescriptionFieldsStorageStorage volumepath, free_space, total_spaceServerChannelsDVR server infoversion, platform, uptime
B.3 ReadOnly State (LLMVisible)
The LLM may read:
* Active playback sessions
* Playback position
* Playback state
* Recordings
* Scheduled recordings
* EPG search results
* Channels
* Commercial markers
* Storage usage
* Job status
* Connected clients
* Device registry entries
The LLM may not read:
* OSlevel details
* Credentials
* Network configuration
* Raw file system paths outside ChannelsDVR

B.4 Actions (LLMCallable)
Actions are grouped by safety level.

B.4.1 SAFE Actions (No Confirmation Required)
Playback
* pause_playback
* resume_playback
* stop_playback
* seek_relative
* seek_absolute
* skip_commercial
* previous_commercial
* next_commercial
* set_playback_speed
* set_volume (if supported by client)
Queries
* get_now_playing
* get_recordings
* get_scheduled_recordings
* get_channels
* search_epg
* get_storage_status
* get_jobs
* get_clients
Recording
* schedule_recording
* schedule_series_recording

B.4.2 CONFIRM Actions (User Confirmation Required)
Recording Management
* cancel_scheduled_recording
* delete_recording
Commercial Skip
* regenerate_commercial_markers

B.4.3 DANGEROUS Actions (Explicit Confirmation Required)
Destructive
* delete_recording_file
* delete_series_rule
These actions must:
* Be confirmed
* Be logged
* Include a safety explanation

B.4.4 OWNER Actions (Authentication Required)
Administrative
* restart_channelsdvr_service
* clear_cache
* rebuild_index
These require:
* “server owner wants you to:” prefix
* Authentication
* Elevated session (15 minutes)

